<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s264S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w2">Another</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w1">part</span> of the glass of water again provides a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w4">material cause</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s264w5">and</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w7">karma</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w6">human</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w10">provides</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w9">contributing factor</span>; and then <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w11">based on</span> both of these the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w16">later</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w15">continuation</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s264w14">of</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w13">one</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w12">part</span> of the glass of water <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w18">starts being</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s264w17">water</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s264w3"><span class="nul">Agent marking realized by active subject syntax, without a separate case word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s264w8"><span class="nul">Agent marking realized by active subject syntax, without a separate case word.</span></span></span>
