<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first proposal; no human semantic approval. The first gcig is contextually Another and the second is one. The one byas pa owns the second provides; again and the first provides are left unwrapped. mi'i and chur retain their whole inflected Tibetan syllables; no bound member is falsely nulled where the genitive or resultative contribution is carried outside the English lexical word. The de'i references are expanded into glass-of-water descriptions and omitted rather than assigned that supplied noun phrase. brten nas owns based on, leaving both of these as an expanded restatement of the two preceding causes.</div>
